  "contentHtml": "<p>3주 동안 인체 기관의 통합적 이해 </p><p>프로젝트 활동을 하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">0</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">프로젝트 수업의 목적 소개</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">모둠 편성</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">제비뽑기</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">및 모둠원별 주제 맡기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자기가 맡은 주제에 대한 자료를 컴퓨터실 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">or </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">스마트폰을 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이용하여 <span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">찾고 정리하기</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3~4</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주제별 박사들끼리 모여 주제에 대한 심화탐구</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">박사들끼리 협력하여 설명 요약 자료 만들기 </span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5~6</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">자기 모둠으로 돌아와 내가 맡은 주제를 우리 모둠원에게 설명하기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">차시 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림체; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">배운 내용 형성평가 및 중간고사 대비 정리 </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">8차시 : 인체의 통합적 이해를 그림으로 표현하기</span><br></p><p><br></p><p>프로젝트를&nbsp;마치고 </p><p>저희 학교 선생님들과 수업 나눔을 하고자 </p><p>활동을 정리해보았습니다.</p><p><br></p><p><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3Ddglf%26dataid%3D44%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20171013152853&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile276.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F99971B3359E05EC3154687')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 수업고민지(성호고 김영학).pdf</a></p><p><br></p><p>* 첨부 파일에&nbsp;문제상황도 정리해보았습니다.<br></p><p>&nbsp; 같이 고민해주세요.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>활동 마지막에 인체기관을 통합적으로 이해할 수 있는 작품 제작으로 마무리하였습니다.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996A4A3359E05DFA0F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"704\" height=\"449\" style=\"width: 704px; height: 449px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20171013_152202096.jpg\"  id=\"A_996A4A3359E05DFA0F1250\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/9925EB3359E195AF0F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"698\" height=\"478\" style=\"width: 698px; height: 478px; clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"960\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"KakaoTalk_20171014_134132820.jpg\"  id=\"A_9925EB3359E195AF0F9F8E\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
